"P1704232608" "The frantic calls from the police dispatcher sound grim. Bail negotiations with the Crey Corporation have broken down, and now Crey agents have occupied a precinct house in Brickstown, claiming some dubious legal precedent. Most likely they're trying to spring one of the agents before their trial. The Police have had to evacuate until reinforcements and lawyers arrive. But there's a loophole in the law that a hero could use."
