"P3588979691" "It sounds like the Crey Corporation isn't happy that the First National Bank in Brickstown has frozen some of their assets pending an investigation. They've sent some of their private security force in to recover their assets by any means neccessary, and they aren't going to care who gets hurt! They've taken 2 tellers hostage, and plan to blow the vault! The police can't move in yet, but a hero could save the day!"
